<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg critical wavelength for Drosophila persimilis at 2.1 µm — Code-to-model traceability: 82/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Each numeric routine maps to one piece of the dispersion relation, the allometry, or the ablation. Lean states the integer order, the onset bound, and the k·λ pin. The docstring states which claims are transfers." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.2e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg critical wavelength for Drosophila persimilis at 2.1 µm — Model fidelity to source: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The integrator is Schnakenberg kinetics with the standard onset wavenumber, periodic boundaries, and an equal-diffusion control that drops the activator standard deviation by about twenty-fold. The critical cosine is seeded at the predicted wavelength, so the run shows that the mode persists, not that noise finds it." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg critical wavelength for Drosophila persimilis at 2.1 µm — Morphometric validation: 70/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "FFT centroids, Pearson r, RMSE, ablation ratio, seed SD, and grid convergence are computed. References are the assigned 2.098 µm tier and the allometric targets, not periods measured on these three species. The orientation KS against the gallery plate is large, which is the correct disagreement, and is not yet the basis of the score." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-beta-endpoint-planitibia-minus-paulistorum-at-beta-0-70>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-persimilis-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-du-sweep-pearson-r-analytic-vs-measured-wavelength>,
